		<div class="entry-content is-layout-constrained">
<div class="vt-wrapper-9x7k"><h1 class="vt-title-9x7k">Patient Testimonials</h1><div class="vt-carousel-9x7k" id="vt-carousel-9x7k-1" role="region" aria-roledescription="carousel" aria-label="Patient Testimonials"><button type="button" class="vt-arrow-9x7k vt-prev-9x7k" aria-label="Previous testimonial" aria-controls="vt-carousel-9x7k-1-track" disabled><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6"/></svg></button><div class="vt-container-9x7k vt-track-9x7k" id="vt-carousel-9x7k-1-track" tabindex="0"><div class="vt-card-9x7k" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="1 of 16"><div class="vt-video-wrapper-9x7k"><video class="vt-video-9x7k" controls playsinline preload="none"><source src="/videos/2026/08/joint-pain-video-testimonial.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video></div><div class="vt-content-c3d4"><p class="vt-testimonial-text-9x7k">Earlier, even simple movements were painful. Now, I’m slowly feeling better every day.</p><div><strong></strong><br><span>Joint Pain</span></div></div></div><div class="vt-card-9x7k" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="2 of 16"><div class="vt-video-wrapper-9x7k"><video class="vt-video-9x7k" controls playsinline preload="none"><source src="/videos/2026/08/wellness-video-testimonial.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video></div><div class="vt-content-c3d4"><p class="vt-testimonial-text-9x7k">After the wellness treatment, I just feel lighter, calmer, and completely relaxed.</p><div><strong></strong><br><span>Wellness</span></div></div></div><div class="vt-card-9x7k" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="3 of 16"><div class="vt-video-wrapper-9x7k"><video class="vt-video-9x7k" controls playsinline preload="none"><source src="/videos/2026/08/kalavathi-kotian-hindi-testimonial.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video></div><div class="vt-content-c3d4"><p class="vt-testimonial-text-9x7k">A heartfelt patient testimonial on overcoming pain and difficulty sitting, and experiencing renewed comfort and confidence after treatment.</p><div><strong>Kalavathi Kotian</strong><br><span>Back Pain</span></div></div></div><div class="vt-card-9x7k" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="4 of 16"><div class="vt-video-wrapper-9x7k"><video class="vt-video-9x7k" controls playsinline preload="none"><source src="/videos/2026/07/pv-testmonial-zeena-arthritis.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video></div><div class="vt-content-c3d4"><p class="vt-testimonial-text-9x7k">I am Zeena, and I am very happy with my treatment at Praanavaidya. My joint pain has improved completely, and I feel more comfortable and active now. Thank you for the wonderful care and support.</p><div><strong>Zeena</strong><br><span>Joint pain</span></div></div></div><div class="vt-card-9x7k" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="5 of 16"><div class="vt-video-wrapper-9x7k"><video class="vt-video-9x7k" controls playsinline preload="none"><source src="/videos/2026/07/pv-testimonial-sulochana-leg-pain.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video></div><div class="vt-content-c3d4"><p class="vt-testimonial-text-9x7k">I am very thankful for the treatment I received at Praanavaidya. I was suffering from back and joint pain, which made my daily activities difficult. After my treatment, I feel much better, with great relief from the pain. I truly appreciate the care and support provided by the team.</p><div><strong>Sulochana</strong><br><span>back and joint pain</span></div></div></div><div class="vt-card-9x7k" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="6 of 16"><div class="vt-video-wrapper-9x7k"><video class="vt-video-9x7k" controls playsinline preload="none"><source src="/videos/2026/07/pv-testimonial-sheetal-chandra-sharma-meningitis.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video></div><div class="vt-content-c3d4"><p class="vt-testimonial-text-9x7k">I am happy to share my recovery experience with Praanavaidya Hospitals. After suffering from meningitis, I received personalized care and treatment that helped me improve my health. Today, I feel better and thankful for the support I received.</p><div><strong>Sheetal Chandra Sharma</strong><br><span>Meningitis</span></div></div></div><div class="vt-card-9x7k" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="7 of 16"><div class="vt-video-wrapper-9x7k"><video class="vt-video-9x7k" controls playsinline preload="none"><source src="/videos/2026/07/pv-testimonial-raj-back-pain.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video></div><div class="vt-content-c3d4"><p class="vt-testimonial-text-9x7k">I had back pain for a long time, and it was making my daily life difficult. One of my friends suggested Praanavaidya, so I decided to visit. The doctors were very supportive and gave me a personalized Ayurvedic treatment. After following the treatment and advice, I felt much better and my back pain reduced a lot. I’m really happy with my experience at Praanavaidya.</p><div><strong>raj</strong><br><span>Back pain</span></div></div></div><div class="vt-card-9x7k" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="8 of 16"><div class="vt-video-wrapper-9x7k"><video class="vt-video-9x7k" controls playsinline preload="none"><source src="/videos/2026/07/pv-testimonial-rahul-skin-problem.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video></div><div class="vt-content-c3d4"><p class="vt-testimonial-text-9x7k">I am Amogh, and after years of struggling with skin issues, Ayurveda gave me new hope. With Virechana therapy and personalized treatment at Praanavaidya Hospitals, I feel relieved, healthier, and grateful for the care I received.</p><div><strong>Amogh</strong><br><span>Skin issues</span></div></div></div><div class="vt-card-9x7k" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="9 of 16"><div class="vt-video-wrapper-9x7k"><video class="vt-video-9x7k" controls playsinline preload="none"><source src="/videos/2026/05/scalp-treatment-testimonial.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video></div><div class="vt-content-c3d4"><p class="vt-testimonial-text-9x7k">Patient is happy and completely relieved of scalp itching after treatment.</p><div><strong>Rajesh</strong><br><span>hair and Scalp Cured</span></div></div></div><div class="vt-card-9x7k" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="10 of 16"><div class="vt-video-wrapper-9x7k"><video class="vt-video-9x7k" controls playsinline preload="none"><source src="/videos/2025/12/skin-treatment.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video></div><div class="vt-content-c3d4"><p class="vt-testimonial-text-9x7k">Struggling with skin issues can be tough, affecting both how you look and how you feel.</p><div><strong>Anirudda</strong><br><span>Rare Skin Disorder Cured</span></div></div></div><div class="vt-card-9x7k" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="11 of 16"><div class="vt-video-wrapper-9x7k"><video class="vt-video-9x7k" controls playsinline preload="none"><source src="/videos/2025/12/joint-pain.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video></div><div class="vt-content-c3d4"><p class="vt-testimonial-text-9x7k">Chronic pain can make everyday life hard.</p><div><strong>Ramamani M J</strong><br><span>Joint Pain Cured</span></div></div></div><div class="vt-card-9x7k" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="12 of 16"><div class="vt-video-wrapper-9x7k"><video class="vt-video-9x7k" controls playsinline preload="none"><source src="/videos/2025/12/diabetis.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video></div><div class="vt-content-c3d4"><p class="vt-testimonial-text-9x7k">Living with diabetes can feel overwhelming.</p><div><strong>Priya</strong><br><span>Diabetes Reversal Cured</span></div></div></div><div class="vt-card-9x7k" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="13 of 16"><div class="vt-video-wrapper-9x7k"><video class="vt-video-9x7k" controls playsinline preload="none"><source src="/videos/2026/03/patient-review-on-psoriasis.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video></div><div class="vt-content-c3d4"><p class="vt-testimonial-text-9x7k">Psoriasis was really hard to deal with. My skin was always irritated, and it affected my confidence. Now, my skin feels much better, and I feel more comfortable in my own skin.</p><div><strong>Sandeep</strong><br><span>Psoriasis Cured</span></div></div></div><div class="vt-card-9x7k" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="14 of 16"><div class="vt-video-wrapper-9x7k"><video class="vt-video-9x7k" controls playsinline preload="none"><source src="/videos/2026/03/patient-revirew-on-diabetic-reversal.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video></div><div class="vt-content-c3d4"><p class="vt-testimonial-text-9x7k">Managing diabetes was tough, but now I see real changes in my health. My blood sugar is better, and I feel more in control of my life.</p><div><strong>Murali Krishna</strong><br><span>Diabetes Reversal Cured</span></div></div></div><div class="vt-card-9x7k" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="15 of 16"><div class="vt-video-wrapper-9x7k"><video class="vt-video-9x7k" controls playsinline preload="none"><source src="/videos/2026/03/PV-R-23.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video></div><div class="vt-content-c3d4"><p class="vt-testimonial-text-9x7k">Having psoriasis was frustrating and uncomfortable. My skin often felt itchy and irritated. Now, my skin is much calmer, and I feel more confident every day</p><div><strong>Gunashekar</strong><br><span>Diabetes Reversal Cured</span></div></div></div><div class="vt-card-9x7k" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="16 of 16"><div class="vt-video-wrapper-9x7k"><video class="vt-video-9x7k" controls playsinline preload="none"><source src="/videos/2026/03/patient-review-on-side-effects.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video></div><div class="vt-content-c3d4"><p class="vt-testimonial-text-9x7k">I’m grateful for the improvement in my overall health. I feel ready and hopeful for the next chapter in our family journey.</p><div><strong>Rachana</strong><br><span>Diabetes Reversal Cured</span></div></div></div></div><button type="button" class="vt-arrow-9x7k vt-next-9x7k" aria-label="Next testimonial" aria-controls="vt-carousel-9x7k-1-track"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 18l6-6-6-6"/></svg></button><div class="vt-dots-9x7k" role="group" aria-label="Choose slide"></div></div></div><script is:inline id="vt-script-9x7k">
(function(){
    var reduce = window.matchMedia && window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
    var behavior = reduce ? 'auto' : 'smooth';

    function initCarousel(root){
        if (root.getAttribute('data-vt-ready')) return;
        root.setAttribute('data-vt-ready', '1');

        var track = root.querySelector('.vt-track-9x7k');
        var prev  = root.querySelector('.vt-prev-9x7k');
        var next  = root.querySelector('.vt-next-9x7k');
        var dots  = root.querySelector('.vt-dots-9x7k');
        var cards = track.children;
        var count = 0, ticking = false;

        function step(){
            return cards.length > 1 ? (cards[1].offsetLeft - cards[0].offsetLeft) : track.clientWidth;
        }
        function maxScroll(){ return track.scrollWidth - track.clientWidth; }

        function go(i){ track.scrollTo({ left: i * step(), behavior: behavior }); }

        function update(){
            ticking = false;
            var x = track.scrollLeft, m = maxScroll();
            prev.disabled = x <= 2;
            next.disabled = x >= m - 2;
            var active = x >= m - 2 ? count - 1 : Math.round(x / step());
            var MAX = 5;
            var start = Math.max(0, Math.min(active - 2, count - MAX));
            var end = Math.min(count - 1, start + MAX - 1);
            for (var i = 0; i < dots.children.length; i++) {
                var on = i === active;
                dots.children[i].hidden = i < start || i > end;
                dots.children[i].classList.toggle('is-edge', !on && ((i === start && start > 0) || (i === end && end < count - 1)));
                dots.children[i].classList.toggle('is-active', on);
                if (on) dots.children[i].setAttribute('aria-current', 'true');
                else dots.children[i].removeAttribute('aria-current');
            }
        }

        function centerArrows(){
            var vw = track.querySelector('.vt-video-wrapper-9x7k');
            if (vw && vw.offsetHeight) {
                root.style.setProperty('--vt-arrow-top', (vw.offsetTop - track.offsetTop + vw.offsetHeight / 2) + 'px');
            }
        }

        function build(){
            centerArrows();
            var m = maxScroll();
            var n = m > 2 ? Math.round(m / step()) + 1 : 1;
            root.classList.toggle('is-static', n < 2);
            if (n !== count) {
                count = n;
                var frag = document.createDocumentFragment();
                for (var i = 0; i < n; i++) {
                    var b = document.createElement('button');
                    b.type = 'button';
                    b.className = 'vt-dot-9x7k';
                    b.setAttribute('aria-label', 'Go to slide ' + (i + 1));
                    b.addEventListener('click', go.bind(null, i));
                    frag.appendChild(b);
                }
                dots.innerHTML = '';
                dots.appendChild(frag);
            }
            update();
        }

        track.scrollLeft = 0; // always start on the first card

        prev.addEventListener('click', function(){ track.scrollBy({ left: -step(), behavior: behavior }); });
        next.addEventListener('click', function(){ track.scrollBy({ left:  step(), behavior: behavior }); });

        track.addEventListener('scroll', function(){
            if (!ticking) { ticking = true; requestAnimationFrame(update); }
        }, { passive: true });

        track.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){
            if (e.key === 'ArrowRight') { e.preventDefault(); next.click(); }
            else if (e.key === 'ArrowLeft') { e.preventDefault(); prev.click(); }
        });

        if ('ResizeObserver' in window) {
            new ResizeObserver(function(){ requestAnimationFrame(build); }).observe(track);
        } else {
            var t; window.addEventListener('resize', function(){ clearTimeout(t); t = setTimeout(build, 150); });
        }
        build();
    }

    function initVideos(){
        var videos = document.querySelectorAll('video.vt-video-9x7k');
        if (!('IntersectionObserver' in window)) return;

        // Load only metadata (first frame) for cards near the screen; pause cards scrolled away.
        var io = new IntersectionObserver(function(entries){
            entries.forEach(function(e){
                var v = e.target;
                if (e.isIntersecting) {
                    if (v.preload === 'none') { v.preload = 'metadata'; }
                } else if (!v.paused) {
                    v.pause();
                }
            });
        }, { rootMargin: '200px 0px' });

        for (var i = 0; i < videos.length; i++) io.observe(videos[i]);
    }

    // Only one testimonial plays at a time.
    function setPlaying(e, state){
        var t = e.target;
        if (!t.classList || !t.classList.contains('vt-video-9x7k')) return;
        var card = t.closest('.vt-card-9x7k');
        if (card) card.classList.toggle('is-playing', state);
    }
    document.addEventListener('play',  function(e){ setPlaying(e, true);  }, true);
    document.addEventListener('pause', function(e){ setPlaying(e, false); }, true);
    document.addEventListener('ended', function(e){ setPlaying(e, false); }, true);

    document.addEventListener('play', function(e){
        var t = e.target;
        if (!t.classList || !t.classList.contains('vt-video-9x7k')) return;
        var all = document.querySelectorAll('video.vt-video-9x7k');
        for (var i = 0; i < all.length; i++) { if (all[i] !== t && !all[i].paused) all[i].pause(); }
    }, true);

    function start(){
        var roots = document.querySelectorAll('.vt-carousel-9x7k');
        for (var i = 0; i < roots.length; i++) initCarousel(roots[i]);
        initVideos();
    }

    if (document.readyState === 'loading') document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', start);
    else start();
})();
</script>
		</div>

	</article>

